[
{
"i": 0,
"t0": 0.29,
"t1": 1.03,
"text": "Tuesday morning."
},
{
"i": 1,
"t0": 1.8,
"t1": 2.89,
"text": "You wake up..."
},
{
"i": 2,
"t0": 2.89,
"t1": 5.72,
"text": "and something is floating above your mom's head."
},
{
"i": 3,
"t0": 6.43,
"t1": 7.5,
"text": "Glowing numbers."
},
{
"i": 4,
"t0": 8.15,
"t1": 9.18,
"text": "Thirty-one years."
},
{
"i": 5,
"t0": 9.47,
"t1": 10.28,
"text": "Four months."
},
{
"i": 6,
"t0": 10.64,
"t1": 11.65,
"text": "Six days."
},
{
"i": 7,
"t0": 11.65,
"t1": 13.94,
"text": "And they're ticking."
},
{
"i": 8,
"t0": 14.24,
"t1": 17.59,
"text": "At breakfast, your little brother has seventy-two years."
},
{
"i": 9,
"t0": 18.1,
"t1": 19.32,
"text": "The cat has..."
},
{
"i": 10,
"t0": 19.88,
"t1": 20.43,
"text": "nine."
},
{
"i": 11,
"t0": 20.43,
"t1": 22.37,
"text": "You step outside."
},
{
"i": 12,
"t0": 23.3,
"t1": 24.63,
"text": "Everyone has one."
},
{
"i": 13,
"t0": 25.19,
"t1": 25.9,
"text": "The bus driver."
},
{
"i": 14,
"t0": 26.21,
"t1": 26.69,
"text": "The baker."
},
{
"i": 15,
"t0": 27.27,
"t1": 28.67,
"text": "A baby in a stroller..."
},
{
"i": 16,
"t0": 29.25,
"t1": 30.45,
"text": "eighty-four years."
},
{
"i": 17,
"t0": 31.57,
"t1": 35.88,
"text": "So what if you could see how long everyone has left?"
},
{
"i": 18,
"t0": 36.9,
"t1": 39.92,
"text": "The average human life today is about seventy-three years."
},
{
"i": 19,
"t0": 40.5,
"t1": 43.78,
"text": "That's roughly twenty-six thousand eight hundred days."
},
{
"i": 20,
"t0": 44.62,
"t1": 46.76,
"text": "And most of them..."
},
{
"i": 21,
"t0": 47.93,
"t1": 49.07,
"text": "we never count."
},
{
"i": 22,
"t0": 49.78,
"t1": 51.08,
"text": "Day one is strange."
},
{
"i": 23,
"t0": 51.93,
"t1": 52.76,
"text": "Day two is worse."
},
{
"i": 24,
"t0": 53.04,
"t1": 54.83,
"text": "On a park bench, an old man is feeding pigeons."
},
{
"i": 25,
"t0": 55.45,
"t1": 56.76,
"text": "His number..."
},
{
"i": 26,
"t0": 56.76,
"t1": 57.63,
"text": "six minutes."
},
{
"i": 27,
"t0": 58.51,
"t1": 59.13,
"text": "You freeze."
},
{
"i": 28,
"t0": 59.86,
"t1": 60.68,
"text": "You could walk away."
},
{
"i": 29,
"t0": 61.22,
"t1": 62.29,
"text": "Nobody would ever know."
},
{
"i": 30,
"t0": 63.27,
"t1": 64.74,
"text": "You sit down next to him instead."
},
{
"i": 31,
"t0": 65.89,
"t1": 66.73,
"text": "His name is Walter."
},
{
"i": 32,
"t0": 67.31,
"t1": 69.07,
"text": "He tells you about his wife, Ruth."
},
{
"i": 33,
"t0": 69.72,
"t1": 71.36,
"text": "Fifty years of breakfasts."
},
{
"i": 34,
"t0": 71.95,
"t1": 72.95,
"text": "She burned the toast..."
},
{
"i": 35,
"t0": 73.52,
"t1": 74.25,
"text": "every single time."
},
{
"i": 36,
"t0": 74.93,
"t1": 75.49,
"text": "He laughs."
},
{
"i": 37,
"t0": 76.35,
"t1": 77.09,
"text": "Then he goes quiet."
},
{
"i": 38,
"t0": 78.05,
"t1": 79.55,
"text": "And the number reaches zero."
},
{
"i": 39,
"t0": 80.83,
"t1": 81.43,
"text": "He's smiling."
},
{
"i": 40,
"t0": 82.55,
"t1": 83.73,
"text": "And you understand something."
},
{
"i": 41,
"t0": 84.59,
"t1": 86.02,
"text": "You can't stop the clock."
},
{
"i": 42,
"t0": 86.74,
"t1": 90.14,
"text": "But you can choose who's sitting next to someone when it stops."
},
{
"i": 43,
"t0": 91.38,
"t1": 96.13,
"text": "Since 1938, Harvard has followed hundreds of people for their entire lives."
},
{
"i": 44,
"t0": 96.61,
"t1": 99.38,
"text": "It's one of the longest studies of adult life ever done."
},
{
"i": 45,
"t0": 100.07,
"t1": 103.31,
"text": "The strongest clue to a long, healthy life wasn't money."
},
{
"i": 46,
"t0": 103.67,
"t1": 104.48,
"text": "It wasn't fame."
},
{
"i": 47,
"t0": 105.28,
"t1": 107.01,
"text": "It was close relationships."
},
{
"i": 48,
"t0": 108.32,
"t1": 109.22,
"text": "Then Friday comes."
},
{
"i": 49,
"t0": 110.23,
"t1": 113.42,
"text": "Your best friend Leo jogs up to you, laughing about some video."
},
{
"i": 50,
"t0": 114.29,
"t1": 114.83,
"text": "You look up."
},
{
"i": 51,
"t0": 115.72,
"t1": 117.39,
"text": "Leo's number..."
},
{
"i": 52,
"t0": 117.39,
"t1": 118.33,
"text": "zero years."
},
{
"i": 53,
"t0": 118.79,
"t1": 119.24,
"text": "Zero days."
},
{
"i": 54,
"t0": 119.24,
"t1": 119.69,
"text": "Two hours."
},
{
"i": 55,
"t0": 120.28,
"t1": 121.38,
"text": "Your stomach drops."
},
{
"i": 56,
"t0": 122.42,
"t1": 123.45,
"text": "You don't tell him."
},
{
"i": 57,
"t0": 124.51,
"t1": 125.14,
"text": "How could you?"
},
{
"i": 58,
"t0": 125.87,
"t1": 128.16,
"text": "You cancel his plans."
},
{
"i": 59,
"t0": 128.71,
"t1": 130.05,
"text": "You walk him home the long way."
},
{
"i": 60,
"t0": 130.52,
"t1": 131.8,
"text": "He thinks you've lost your mind."
},
{
"i": 61,
"t0": 132.74,
"t1": 134.02,
"text": "Six minutes left."
},
{
"i": 62,
"t0": 134.84,
"t1": 135.47,
"text": "The crosswalk."
},
{
"i": 63,
"t0": 136.15,
"t1": 137.09,
"text": "The light turns green."
},
{
"i": 64,
"t0": 138.04,
"t1": 139.11,
"text": "Leo steps forward..."
},
{
"i": 65,
"t0": 139.46,
"t1": 140.5,
"text": "and you grab his hoodie."
},
{
"i": 66,
"t0": 141.6,
"t1": 143.1,
"text": "A truck runs the red light."
},
{
"i": 67,
"t0": 143.4,
"t1": 144.24,
"text": "Inches away."
},
{
"i": 68,
"t0": 145.33,
"t1": 145.94,
"text": "Silence."
},
{
"i": 69,
"t0": 146.92,
"t1": 147.36,
"text": "You look up."
},
{
"i": 70,
"t0": 148.2,
"t1": 151.33,
"text": "Leo's number is spinning..."
},
{
"i": 71,
"t0": 152.27,
"t1": 153.54,
"text": "then it stops."
},
{
"i": 72,
"t0": 153.54,
"t1": 155.05,
"text": "Sixty-one years."
},
{
"i": 73,
"t0": 155.98,
"t1": 156.58,
"text": "He's shaking."
},
{
"i": 74,
"t0": 157.57,
"t1": 158.99,
"text": "How did you know?"
},
{
"i": 75,
"t0": 158.99,
"t1": 160.4,
"text": "You don't answer."
},
{
"i": 76,
"t0": 160.88,
"t1": 162.4,
"text": "You just hug him."
},
{
"i": 77,
"t0": 163.67,
"t1": 167.88,
"text": "Road crashes kill about one point two million people every year."
},
{
"i": 78,
"t0": 168.53,
"t1": 169.84,
"text": "More than two every minute."
},
{
"i": 79,
"t0": 170.63,
"t1": 176.13,
"text": "And they're the leading cause of death for people aged five to twenty-nine."
},
{
"i": 80,
"t0": 176.34,
"t1": 177.77,
"text": "So the numbers can change."
},
{
"i": 81,
"t0": 178.99,
"t1": 180.84,
"text": "That night, you stand in front of the mirror."
},
{
"i": 82,
"t0": 181.4,
"t1": 183.18,
"text": "For the first time, you look for your own."
},
{
"i": 83,
"t0": 184.38,
"t1": 186.24,
"text": "Above your head..."
},
{
"i": 84,
"t0": 187.3,
"t1": 187.71,
"text": "nothing."
},
{
"i": 85,
"t0": 188.66,
"t1": 189.08,
"text": "No number."
},
{
"i": 86,
"t0": 190.25,
"t1": 190.61,
"text": "Just you."
},
{
"i": 87,
"t0": 190.61,
"t1": 192.05,
"text": "You can see everyone's time..."
},
{
"i": 88,
"t0": 192.59,
"t1": 193.32,
"text": "except yours."
},
{
"i": 89,
"t0": 194.27,
"t1": 195.54,
"text": "Maybe that's the point."
},
{
"i": 90,
"t0": 196.31,
"t1": 197.84,
"text": "Nobody gets to see their own clock."
},
{
"i": 91,
"t0": 198.57,
"t1": 200.41,
"text": "So the only thing you can do..."
},
{
"i": 92,
"t0": 201.06,
"t1": 201.66,
"text": "is not waste it."
},
{
"i": 93,
"t0": 202.77,
"t1": 203.42,
"text": "You text your mom."
},
{
"i": 94,
"t0": 204.18,
"t1": 204.48,
"text": "Love you."
},
{
"i": 95,
"t0": 205.36,
"t1": 206.69,
"text": "She replies with three hearts."
},
{
"i": 96,
"t0": 207.56,
"t1": 208.41,
"text": "Thirty-one years."
},
{
"i": 97,
"t0": 209.28,
"t1": 212.01,
"text": "You plan to fill every one of them."
},
{
"i": 98,
"t0": 212.36,
"t1": 212.92,
"text": "So what's real?"
},
{
"i": 99,
"t0": 213.67,
"t1": 215.22,
"text": "No one can see a countdown."
},
{
"i": 100,
"t0": 215.68,
"t1": 218.38,
"text": "Life expectancy is an average, not a promise."
},
{
"i": 101,
"t0": 219.23,
"t1": 223.34,
"text": "What shortens most lives is slow: smoking, sitting still, loneliness."
},
{
"i": 102,
"t0": 223.64,
"t1": 227.23,
"text": "And what lengthens them is almost boring..."
},
{
"i": 103,
"t0": 227.79,
"t1": 230.6,
"text": "sleep, movement, and the people you love."
},
{
"i": 104,
"t0": 231.67,
"t1": 233.62,
"text": "What would you do if you saw your own number?"
},
{
"i": 105,
"t0": 234.41,
"t1": 236.02,
"text": "And what if you could pause time?"
},
{
"i": 106,
"t0": 237.02,
"t1": 240.46,
"text": "Tell us in the comments, and tell us which power we should live next."
},
{
"i": 107,
"t0": 241.19,
"t1": 242.84,
"text": "Hit like, and subscribe for more."
}
]